
# 🧠 ML Integration Rules - BibleAppPOCV2

## 🎯 **Core Principle: Clean Export > Manual Sanitization**

**NEW APPROACH**: Character encoding corruption issues have been resolved at the **root cause** through clean Core ML model export with byte-safe, UTF-8-clean fast tokenizer. This eliminates the need for extensive post-generation sanitization.

**OLD APPROACH (DEPRECATED)**: Complex text sanitization layers in Swift that treated symptoms rather than causes.

